    "updated_at": "2017-02-03T06:16:31Z",
    "body": "Fullscreen spec doesn't need any change at present (and probably neither in the future, as DOM spec may be the centric place for legacy event type). We haven't yet specced legacy fullscreen events, and we may or may not need to spec it. But I think it makes more sense to share the same mechanism even for unspecced things.",
